# A line wider than the window, which milestone one cuts rather than scrolls
# sideways (ADR-0381). Two things are claimed: what is drawn stops at the
# window's width, and the *cursor* stops with it -- the status line goes on
# counting in the document, so a person can see that the cursor is at column
# 30 while the drawing stops at 12. That disagreement is the limitation
# showing itself, and it is better than a cursor that vanishes.
name wide.pas
size 5 12
push abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
draw
esc F
draw
